{
  "_comment": [
    "EXAMPLE ONLY. Replace every entry with the queries the realm under test",
    "actually issues, transcribed from its card source. The shapes here are",
    "invented placeholders that match no real realm.",
    "",
    "Queries are written in the `_federated-search` ENTRY wire grammar: the",
    "type anchor is `item.on`, and field paths inside eq/contains/in/range",
    "carry an `item.` prefix. `${realm}` expands to the realm URL under test.",
    "Every key other than `label` is sent to the endpoint as-is, so `sort` and",
    "`page` work here too. See lib/workload.ts."
  ],

  "queries": [
    {
      "label": "Widget",
      "filter": {
        "item.on": { "module": "${realm}schema/widget", "name": "Widget" }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Gadget",
      "filter": {
        "item.on": { "module": "${realm}schema/gadget", "name": "Gadget" }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Sprocket",
      "filter": {
        "item.on": { "module": "${realm}schema/sprocket", "name": "Sprocket" }
      }
    }
  ],

  "secondaryQueries": [
    {
      "label": "Widget(secondary)",
      "filter": {
        "item.on": { "module": "${realm}schema/widget", "name": "Widget" }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Notice",
      "filter": {
        "item.on": { "module": "${realm}schema/notice", "name": "Notice" }
      }
    }
  ],

  "extraQueries": [
    {
      "label": "Sprocket(bounded)",
      "filter": {
        "item.on": { "module": "${realm}schema/sprocket", "name": "Sprocket" },
        "eq": { "item.category": "active" }
      }
    }
  ],

  "write": {
    "path": "WidgetReport",
    "adoptsFrom": {
      "module": "${realm}schema/widget-report",
      "name": "WidgetReport"
    },
    "attributes": {
      "title": "Load harness report ${n}",
      "reportedOn": "${date}",
      "body": "Written by the load harness."
    }
  }
}
